[38;2;124;124;124m$$I_n = \int (\psi'(s))^2 (f_n'(f_n^{-1}(s)))^2 \cdot f_n^{-1}(s) \cdot [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m\frac{ds}{f_n'(f_n^{-1}(s))}$$[0m
