[38;2;124;124;124mThis is getting complicated. Let me think differently.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThe idea: we want to make the transition happen at very small $r$ values, where [0m[38;2;124;124;124mthe weight $r$ is small. But the constraint is that $\psi_n \equiv 1$ near $[1, [0m[38;2;124;124;124m\infty)$, so the transition must happen in $(0, 1)$.[0m

