[38;2;124;124;124mWith $\psi_n(r) = \psi(2^n r)$: the transition happens where $2^n r \in [a, b]$,[0m[38;2;124;124;124mi.e., $r \in [a/2^n, b/2^n]$. In this region, $r \sim 1/2^n$, $\psi_n'(r) = 2^n [0m[38;2;124;124;124m\psi'(2^n r) \sim 2^n$, and the width of the region is $\sim 1/2^n$.[0m

